---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — Your Data Stays in Your Browser | ChartsAI"
  description="How ChartsAI handles files, pasted values and habit lists. Browser-based processing, no cloud saving, and no account required."
  ><article class="container prose-page">
    <span class="eyebrow">THE DETAILS</span><h1>
      Your data.<br /><em>Your device.</em>
    </h1><p class="byline">Last updated September 8, 2026</p><h2>Files and values</h2><p>
      Chart values, spreadsheet files and tracker labels are processed in your browser. They are not uploaded
      to ChartsAI or sent to an AI provider. PDF and image downloads are generated locally. Fonts and
      application libraries are served as part of the website.
    </p><h2>Storage</h2><p>
      This version does not create an account, use tracking cookies, save your inputs to a cloud database, or
      retain a completion history. Edits are held in the open page and are lost when it is refreshed or
      closed. Download your output or CSV data to keep a copy.
    </p><h2>Ordinary website requests</h2><p>
      Your browser requests the website’s pages, scripts, fonts and styles from the hosting service. As with
      other websites, the host may process technical information such as an IP address and request time to
      deliver the site and protect it. These requests do not include your entered chart data or habits.
    </p><h2>Measurement</h2><p>
      We use Plausible Analytics on the production ChartsAI website to understand aggregate visits, referring
      websites, device/browser categories, and whether people import data or download an output. Custom events
      contain only a fixed tool name and download format. We also count example selections, source-archive
      clicks and visits to SupaMakers. These events do not include your chart values, uploaded files, titles,
      series names, source notes or habit text. Arbitrary URL queries and referrer paths are removed before
      analytics requests are sent.
    </p><p>
      Plausible does not use cookies or persistent identifiers. It processes request information such as IP
      address and user agent to produce aggregate statistics; see its <a
        href="https://plausible.io/data-policy">data policy</a
      >. Analytics is not required to use the tools. Local development and preview hostnames do not load it.
      Search engines may independently provide aggregate search-performance information.
    </p><h2>Links and feedback</h2><p>
      External links, including SupaMakers and documentation sources, have their own privacy practices. If you
      email feedback, the information you choose to send will be received through the email service. Avoid
      sending confidential source files.
    </p><h2>Contact</h2><p>
      ChartsAI is operated by SupaMakers Limited. Privacy questions can be sent to <a
        href="mailto:support@chartsai.com">support@chartsai.com</a
      >.
    </p>
  </article></Layout
>
